---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Website Terms"
  description="Terms for using the Meyppi website and the free check: indicative results, your rights to the creative you upload, and limits of liability."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <h1>Website Terms</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 7 October 2026</p>

      <p>
        These terms cover use of this website and the free check. Paid
        campaign audits are governed by the
        <a href="/service-terms">Service Terms</a> and your engagement
        letter.
      </p>

      <h2>The free check</h2>
      <p>
        Free-check results are indicative findings produced by computation
        in your browser, provided as-is and without warranty of any kind.
        They are not a campaign audit and carry no analyst review. The
        matching parameters match the audit engine, but a paid audit adds
        source verification, version discrimination across all contracted
        versions, exception review by an analyst, and a reproducible
        evidence file.
      </p>

      <h2>Your obligations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You must have the right to use any creative file or URL you submit to the free check.</li>
        <li>The service is for checking your own contracted placements. Automated, bulk or systematic use is not permitted.</li>
        <li>Do not use the site or proxy to fetch media you are not authorised to access.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Results and disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        Findings are algorithmic evidence, not legal proof, and must not be
        presented as such. A finding of Not Detected on dynamically
        inserted advertising can mean the ad was stitched per listener and
        is absent from the public feed. Meyppi's engine calibration is
        validated on synthetic corpora; real-world performance is being
        established.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, Meyppi is not liable for
        decisions made on the basis of free-check results, or for
        indirect or consequential losses arising from use of this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
